      "id": "GrandLakeRoute213Lobby_Text_YouMayRest",
      "en_US": [
        "Ah, hello. You wish to stay a night?\n",
        "Ah, but you’ve no reservations.\r",
        "I’m afraid we are totally booked.\n",
        "You may rest a while, if you wish.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
