      "en_US": [
        "We’ve restored your Pokémon\n",
        "to full health.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "GrandLakeRoute213Lobby_Text_HotelIsSoRomantic",
      "en_US": [
        "This hotel is so romantic...\r",
        "I hope a knight on a Pokémon will\n",
        "sweep me away for a honeymoon here!"
